# Build-context filter for the worker Dockerfile (build context = repo root).
# Keeps the context small and prevents secrets from ever entering the image.
#
# We intentionally do NOT exclude apps/web, apps/ig-publisher, packages/remotion
# at the directory level because the Dockerfile's deps stage needs their
# package.json / requirements.txt to compute the workspace topology, and
# Docker doesn't allow re-including children of an excluded parent.
# **/node_modules below is the real space saver — that's where the bulk lives.

# ─── Build artifacts & caches ────────────────────────────────────────────────
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.next
**/.turbo
**/coverage
**/.vite
**/.parcel-cache
**/tsconfig.tsbuildinfo

# ─── Local env & secrets ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
**/.env
**/.env.local
**/.env.*.local
**/.env.development
**/.env.production

# ─── Editors & OS ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
**/.vscode
**/.idea
**/.DS_Store
**/Thumbs.db

# ─── Git / CI ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.git
.github
.gitignore
.gitattributes

# ─── Tests / fixtures / docs we don't need at runtime ────────────────────────
**/__tests__
**/*.test.ts
**/*.test.tsx
**/*.spec.ts
**/playwright-report
**/test-results
docs

# ─── Worktrees, plans, scratch ───────────────────────────────────────────────
.claude
.worktrees
.conductor
.plans

# ─── Heavy app sources not used by either Dockerfile ─────────────────────────
# These dirs are big but we keep their package.json for workspace resolution.
# NOTE: do NOT exclude apps/web/public — the web Dockerfile needs it for
# static assets (carousel presets, templates). Same for apps/ig-publisher/app
# which the ig-publisher Dockerfile copies. Only exclude truly unused stuff.
apps/web/.next
apps/web/playwright-report
apps/web/test-results
apps/web/e2e
packages/remotion/out
